SUMMARY:Psychic Vibrations - Fact or Analogy?
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\n-Free Admission - Refres
 hments - Open to the public-\n\nPsychic Vibrations - Fact or Analogy?\nwri
 tten by Edgar Wirt\, Ph.D.\, F.R.C.\, I.R.C.\, for the Rosicrucian Digest 
 May 1984\n\nVibration is a useful model for conceptualizing some psychic p
 henomena and it often opens the door to greater understanding of esoteric 
 principles. It may be true that psychic energies are vibratory or act as i
 f they were\, but some experiments in parapsychology indicate that they ar
 e not in the same family as the oscillating energies with which science de
 als. Join us to find out more about how this concept continues to evolve.\
 n\nDiscussion facilitated by Dan Villalva\, F.R.C.\, secretary for the San
 ta Rosa Pronaos.\n\nAbout the Santa Rosa Pronaos\nWe hold a monthly public
  presentation on mystical or metaphysical topics as a public service. The 
 topics and speakers vary and no previous knowledge or experience is requir
 ed. Just bring an open mind and heart.\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos doesn't c
 harge for admission. We operate under the law of AMRA. You may give as you
 r heart and mind direct you.\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos is a 501c3 educatio
 nal non-profit\, an affiliated body or the Rosicrucian English Grand Lodge
  for the Americas and the Caribbean.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31658
 5940/
