SUMMARY:Reflections on Suffering
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nTopic:\n**Reflections on
  Suffering**\n**Atrium Group Convocation presented by Frank Nappi\, F.R.C.
 **\n\nIn this message we learn that as students on the mystical path we sh
 ould regard every painful experience as a lesson and determine to use it w
 hen progressing on the road towards wisdom. Every event in our earthly lif
 e contributes to our inner evolution. That is why every step we take in ou
 r life’s journey leads us towards greater understanding and awakens in u
 s knowledge of one’s self.\n\nAll AMORC members\, their families and fri
 ends of the Rosicrucian Order are welcome to attend. We are delighted to h
 ave you join us in this inspiring ritual.\n\n• Important to know- Doors 
 open for members and non-member friends of the Rosicrucian Order by 6:30 P
 M. Please arrive early! The Atrium Group ritual begins promptly at 7:00 PM
 . AMORC Members - please bring your Active member credentials or Active me
 mbership dues receipt.\n\nFollowing the meeting:\n1st Tuesday- Mystical Se
 ekers Series Public Presentation at 8:00 PM\n\nAs always\, our events are 
 free\, and donations are gratefully accepted to help defray our costs.\n\n
 The Santa Rosa Pronaos is a 501c3 educational non-profit\, an affiliated b
 ody of the Rosicrucian English Grand Lodge for the Americas and the Caribb
 ean.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31658
 4418/
